data: {"id": "76b5ed340fb94317-thinking-parallel_evidence-888", "run_id": "76b5ed340fb94317", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Pod 真实状态 (Kubernetes + Metrics)\n- **Phase**: `Pending`，**Container状态**: `Waiting (ContainerCreating)`，`containers with unready status: [app]`\n- **Node**: `node2/10.2.0.50` (通过拓扑关系确认调度到 node2)\n- **Owner**: `ReplicaSet/workload-5dbb5dcd6c` → `Deployment/workload` (aiops.lab/case-id=c05)\n- **PromQL 事实**:\n  - `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1, reason = `\"ContainerCreating\"` (直接验证了 ContainerCreating)\n  - `kube_pod_status_phase` = 1 for phase=`\"Pending\"` (phase 验证)\n  - `k", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788782523963, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "76b5ed340fb94317-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "76b5ed340fb94317", "seq": 889, "ts_ms": 1788782531976, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 49.527, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-05", "name": "workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/76b5ed340fb94317-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "e9b8b6794f3c61a00ad5dd274d099d5234478253a6fd7d748baefe9505e8c01d", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "d9f2e01763ff94744634fc8b387852f89d5aed20b902d4ff63a50edc8d0e5d18"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "76b5ed340fb94317-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "76b5ed340fb94317", "seq": 890, "ts_ms": 1788782531977, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "76b5ed340fb94317-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "76b5ed340fb94317", "seq": 891, "ts_ms": 1788782540725, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 8.748, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 2002, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx 配置了 Multus CNI 注解 `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavailable-network`，但在该命名空间下不存在对应的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源。这导致 Multus 插件在初始化 Pod Sandbox 时找不到网络定义并报错，引发 kubelet 持续抛出 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 事件，使 Pod 卡在 `Pending` 和 `ContainerCreating` 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Container `app` waiting_reason: `ContainerCreating` (fact_id: fact-abc14a739178) | 确认 Pod 处于初始化停滞状态，容器尚未启动。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning NoNetworkFound ... multus cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` (fact_id: fact-06dc0978b4c2) | 直接指明 Multus CNI 插件在尝试查找指定网络定义时失败。 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning FailedCreatePodSandBox ... rpc error: code = Unknown desc = failed to setup network for sandbox ... plugin type=\"multus\" ... error in getting the delegate: getKubernetesDelegate: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) ... not found` (fact_id: fact-65eeefa14f6b) | 确认底层失败机制为 Pod Sandbox 创建时 Multus 网络插件初始化网络失败。 |\n\n**证据印证说明：**\n状态面显示容器卡在 `ContainerCreating`；事件面提供了明确的失败原因链：Pod 配置的 `unavailable-network` 网络注解在命名空间 `aiops-case-05` 中不存在，导致 Multus 插件无法加载网络配置，进而引发 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误，解释了容器无法启动的直接原因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n缺少 NetworkAttachmentDefinition \"unavailable-network\" → Multus 插件初始化网络失败 → Pod Sandbox 创建失败 (FailedCreatePodSandBox) → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **网络配置缺失**。Pod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 配置了引用 `unavailable-network` 的 Multus CNI 注解，但 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间下不存在对应的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源（事实 #2 和 #3）。这导致 Multus 插件在初始化网络时找不到定义并报错，最终使得 kubelet 无法创建 Pod Sandbox（事实 #3），导致容器状态持续为 `ContainerCreating`（事实 #1）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx 配置了 Multus CNI 注解 `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavailable-network`，但在该命名空间下不存在对应的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源。这导致 Multus 插件在初始化 Pod Sandbox 时找不到网络定义并报错，引发 kubelet 持续抛出 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 事件，使 Pod 卡在 `Pending` 和 `ContainerCreating` 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Container `app` waiting_reason: `ContainerCreating` (fact_id: fact-abc14a739178) | 确认 Pod 处于初始化停滞状态，容器尚未启动。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning NoNetworkFound ... multus cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` (fact_id: fact-06dc0978b4c2) | 直接指明 Multus CNI 插件在尝试查找指定网络定义时失败。 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning FailedCreatePodSandBox ... rpc error: code = Unknown desc = failed to setup network for sandbox ... plugin type=\"multus\" ... error in getting the delegate: getKubernetesDelegate: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) ... not found` (fact_id: fact-65eeefa14f6b) | 确认底层失败机制为 Pod Sandbox 创建时 Multus 网络插件初始化网络失败。 |\n\n**证据印证说明：**\n状态面显示容器卡在 `ContainerCreating`；事件面提供了明确的失败原因链：Pod 配置的 `unavailable-network` 网络注解在命名空间 `aiops-case-05` 中不存在，导致 Multus 插件无法加载网络配置，进而引发 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误，解释了容器无法启动的直接原因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n缺少 NetworkAttachmentDefinition \"unavailable-network\" → Multus 插件初始化网络失败 → Pod Sandbox 创建失败 (FailedCreatePodSandBox) → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **网络配置缺失**。Pod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 配置了引用 `unavailable-network` 的 Multus CNI 注解，但 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间下不存在对应的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源（事实 #2 和 #3）。这导致 Multus 插件在初始化网络时找不到定义并报错，最终使得 kubelet 无法创建 Pod Sandbox（事实 #3），导致容器状态持续为 `ContainerCreating`（事实 #1）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

