data: {"id": "76b5ed340fb94317-final", "run_id": "76b5ed340fb94317", "seq": 893, "ts_ms": 1788782540734, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx 配置了 Multus CNI 注解 `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavailable-network`，但在该命名空间下不存在对应的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源。这导致 Multus 插件在初始化 Pod Sandbox 时找不到网络定义并报错，引发 kubelet 持续抛出 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 事件，使 Pod 卡在 `Pending` 和 `ContainerCreating` 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Container `app` waiting_reason: `ContainerCreating` (fact_id: fact-abc14a739178) | 确认 Pod 处于初始化停滞状态，容器尚未启动。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning NoNetworkFound ... multus cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` (fact_id: fact-06dc0978b4c2) | 直接指明 Multus CNI 插件在尝试查找指定网络定义时失败。 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning FailedCreatePodSandBox ... rpc error: code = Unknown desc = failed to setup network for sandbox ... plugin type=\"multus\" ... error in getting the delegate: getKubernetesDelegate: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) ... not found` (fact_id: fact-65eeefa14f6b) | 确认底层失败机制为 Pod Sandbox 创建时 Multus 网络插件初始化网络失败。 |\n\n**证据印证说明：**\n状态面显示容器卡在 `ContainerCreating`；事件面提供了明确的失败原因链：Pod 配置的 `unavailable-network` 网络注解在命名空间 `aiops-case-05` 中不存在，导致 Multus 插件无法加载网络配置，进而引发 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误，解释了容器无法启动的直接原因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n缺少 NetworkAttachmentDefinition \"unavailable-network\" → Multus 插件初始化网络失败 → Pod Sandbox 创建失败 (FailedCreatePodSandBox) → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **网络配置缺失**。Pod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 配置了引用 `unavailable-network` 的 Multus CNI 注解，但 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间下不存在对应的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源（事实 #2 和 #3）。这导致 Multus 插件在初始化网络时找不到定义并报错，最终使得 kubelet 无法创建 Pod Sandbox（事实 #3），导致容器状态持续为 `ContainerCreating`（事实 #1）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 49.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx: 49.5s (Evidence 41.6s, RCA 7.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 75.268, "metrics": {"run_id": "76b5ed340fb94317", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 75.2755012512207, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 75275.5012512207, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 59570.982217788696, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 39128.31664085388, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 15245.19944190979}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 16978.979349136353, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 49526.83758735657, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 8748.339891433716, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

